# Source PDFs: re-downloadable from official sources (Ontario/Cambridge),
# heavy (~74MB total), and Crown-copyright redistribution is unclear. The
# extracted markdown in corpus/ is the actual RAG input and IS committed;
# the extraction scripts need these PDFs locally to re-run.
corpus/OBC/*.pdf
corpus/cambridge-zoning-bylaw/*.pdf
